  "notes": "### Windows x64 2.3.4\n\n[Download the one-file Windows installer](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.4/ENG-Drawing-Viewer-2.3.4-Windows-x64-Setup.exe) for 64-bit Windows 10 (1809 or later) or Windows 11.\n\n- Standards is now **Reference**. The toolbar has a compact pen-width field, and the arrows switch between open documents.\n- Scroll continuously from one PDF page to the next. Pages render as they come into view.\n- Add text annotations. Use Ctrl+Z to undo completed annotation edits across pages in the active document and Ctrl+Y or Ctrl+Shift+Z to redo them.\n\nSource commit: 30e888ff5a736b676aa3f50ce1f0a74c3b944af2. The [corresponding source archive](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.4/eng-drawing-viewer-2.3.4-source.zip), [third-party source references](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.4/THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES-Windows-x64.txt), and [SHA-256 checksums](https://github.com/ca-works/eng-drawing-viewer/releases/download/v2.3.4/SHA256SUMS.txt) accompany the installer.\n",
